incorporation_legal_framework.pro_forma_first_board_resolution_en:
RESOLVED, that the incorporators' subscriptions for the common shares of the Corporation, as set out in the share records, are approved and the subscribed consideration is deemed received;

RESOLVED, that the Corporation's registered office is fixed at the address in the Articles of Incorporation, and the minute book and records shall be kept there;

RESOLVED, that the Corporation's by-laws are adopted;

RESOLVED, that the following officers are appointed until replaced: Chief Executive Officer, Chief Technology Officer and Corporate Secretary;

RESOLVED, that the officers are authorized to open bank accounts and to complete all provincial and federal registrations.
